Description: GTK4 control center for the ASUS ROG Flow Z13
 z13center is a desktop control center for the 2025 ASUS ROG Flow Z13.
 It provides live telemetry, fan-curve editing, power controls, battery
 settings, and Aura lighting controls through the external z13ctl daemon.
 .
 When z13ctl is unavailable, the application stays usable in preview mode.
